{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Bullet_Horse.png?t=1752494586\" /></div><strong>A LATIN COWBOY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the amazing experience of being a Gaucho, a latin cowboy, and take care of your own land. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Interaction_with_animals.gif?t=1752494586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Bullet_Horse.png?t=1752494586\" /></div><strong>RAISE FARM ANIMALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without agriculture: here the focus is on taking care of your animals, from building perfect places to shelter them to breeding them so that your land can have more resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/GIF_2_-_Crie_animais.gif?t=1752494586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Bullet_Horse.png?t=1752494586\" /></div><strong>DIVE INTO A GREAT ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alongside your horse and your faithful dog, explore different biomes at any time and in any weather condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/GIF3_-_GRANDE_AVENTURA.gif?t=1752494586\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Bullet_Horse.png?t=1752494586\" /></div><strong>HELP PEOPLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your charisma, to unlock new paths and resources, helping residents and evolving your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/GIF4_-_Ajude_Pessoas.gif?t=1752494586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Bullet_Horse.png?t=1752494586\" /></div>MYSTICAL BEINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the adventure, experience incredible missions to save the legends of Latin folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Legends_of_local_folklore.gif?t=1752494586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/fleur_divider.png?t=1752494586\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1670830?t=1752494586","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/59955de123eaa7d9a483b3a96c67fde244de281d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752494586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/62a87672170e89cc403faacee9779f0b6c74c1a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752494586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/62a87672170e89cc403faacee9779f0b6c74c1a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752494586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Ful