g>DIVE INTO A GREAT ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alongside your horse and your faithful dog, explore different biomes at any time and in any weather condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/GIF3_-_GRANDE_AVENTURA.gif?t=1752494586\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Bullet_Horse.png?t=1752494586\" /></div><strong>HELP PEOPLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your charisma, to unlock new paths and resources, helping residents and evolving your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/GIF4_-_Ajude_Pessoas.gif?t=1752494586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Bullet_Horse.png?t=1752494586\" /></div>MYSTICAL BEINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the adventure, experience incredible missions to save the legends of Latin folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/Legends_of_local_folklore.gif?t=1752494586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/fleur_divider.png?t=1752494586\" /></div></p>","developers":["Epopeia Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"